//! SHOGun-Core REST slice (`/rest/users`, `groups`, `roles`, `layers`,
//! `layerdatasources`, `layerappearances`) as a standalone service.
//!
//! Configuration: `DATABASE_URL` (PostgreSQL, schema as created by the Java
